# The JVM tools the build runs, each resolved on its own (the KMP libraries above need maven_kmp's variant
# resolution; these are plain Maven artifacts). Renovate bumps the versions here; `bazel/renovate/repin.sh` re-pins.
# Maven resolution keeps the version a POM asks for, often years old (logback, protobuf, guava, asm), and doesn't read
# Gradle's module metadata, which moves a KMP library's `-jvm` artifact and the Kotlin stdlib to the newest any
# dependency asks for. So an install lists those transitive libraries too, at their newest, and
# `version_conflict_policy = "pinned"` makes the listed versions win.
maven = use_extension("@rules_jvm_external//:extensions.bzl", "maven")

